    date "2022-03-09T23:33:45Z"
    title "Why high gas prices may be here to stay"
    description "Oil was already at a premium coming out of the pandemic, with high demand and tight supply. The war in Ukraine has only made the situation worse. Here's what to expect as gas clears $4 a gallon in much of the U.S., and why the ban on Russian oil imports may not make a big difference. &#34;Tremendous volatility and uncertainty,&#34; says one analyst. &#34;Buckle up, because it could be a pretty wild ride.&#34; Read more: https://wapo.st/37jkMqM. Subscribe to The Washington Post on YouTube: https://wapo.st/2QOdcqK&#10;&#10;Follow us:&#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/washingtonpost&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/washingtonpost/&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/washingtonpost/"
