    description "White House Press Secretary Jen Psaki has used a contentious question-and-answer session with a Fox News correspondent to refute reports blaming President Joe Biden&#8217;s energy policies for recent high gas prices.&#10;&#10;While addressing reporters at her daily news briefing, Ms Psaki was pressed by Fox News reporter Peter Doocy on reports that the Biden Administration is looking to backstop a potential ban on Russian oil imports by bringing in a new supply from Iran or Venezuela.&#10;&#10;Both countries are currently blocked from selling oil on US markets by economic sanctions imposed during the Trump administration.&#10;&#10;Watch more on Independent TV: &#10;&#10;Like us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/TheIndependentOnline&#10;Follow us on Twitter: https://twitter.com/Independent&#10;Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/the.independent&#10;&#10;Subscribe to Independent Premium for exclusive content and live events: https://bit.ly/2MiOONB"
