arn how to fix your car and how it works. Get a chance to show off your own car on Sundays. Or show off your own car mod on Wednesdays. Tool giveaways every Monday to help you with your own car projects. We have a new video every day! I've been an auto mechanic for the past 50 years and I'm here to share my knowledge with you.&#10;&#10;&#9658;Here's our weekly video schedule:&#10;Monday: Tool giveaway&#10;Tuesday: Auto repair video&#10;Wednesday: Viewers car mod show off&#10;Thursday: Viewer Car Question Video AND Live Car Q&#38;A&#10;Friday: Auto repair video&#10;Saturday: Second Live Car Q&#38;A&#10;Sunday: Viewers car show off&#10;&#10;&#9658;Second Daily Upload Every Afternoon of Live Car Q&#38;A videos as well!&#10;&#10;As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases.&#10;#savagescotty"
